      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `detect_image_labels.py` that detects labels or objects in a static image using a concrete external provider, I will use the Google Cloud Vision API. This API is a powerful tool for image analysis and object detection. I will import the necessary client library and use the `vision` client to perform the label detection. The provider will be identifiable by the import statement and the use of the `vision` client, which is specific to Google Cloud Vision. </thinking>\n",
